{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54097","headline":"和舍弟寄题东林寺 · 裴谟","name":"和舍弟寄题东林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元非附凤龙客，本是山猿野鹿身。\n虚向班行纡[组]（祖）绂，争如[□□□□]尘。\n欢同玉季爲良伴，喜奉金[□□□]因。\n今日香炉峰下过，方欣物外有遗民。\n（见《吉石盦丛书》本《庐山记》卷四，缺讹据罗振玉《殷礼在斯堂丛书》校排本补改）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴谟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}